  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Laplace’s Demon — Innate Technique (3rd level)</em></p><p>Starting at 3rd level, you can accelerate your brain to predict the future and past with frightful accuracy.<br />\n When you finish a long rest, roll two d20s and record the numbers rolled. You can spend 1 CE as a reaction to replace any attack roll, saving throw, or ability check you make, or a saving throw you force another creature to make with one of these foretelling rolls. You must choose to do so before the roll.<br />\nEach foretelling roll can be used only once. When you finish a long rest, you lose any unused foretelling rolls. When you complete a short rest, you can spend 1 CE to gain another foretelling roll. You can only have one foretelling roll from a short rest at a time.  </p>",
